      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "Finding New Products\n1) We use the extension as a natural way to crowdsource discovery. \nEvery product viewed gets added to the product database and starts tracking price, \nif its not added yet.\n2) We can also web crawl according to \"newly added\" lists from amazon.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Finding New Products\n1) We use the extension as a natural way to crowdsource discovery. \nEvery product viewed gets added to the product database and starts tracking price, \nif its not added yet.\n2) We can also web crawl according to \"newly added\" lists from amazon.",
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "baseline": 115
